# Online Attention to Digital Humanities Publications (#DH2014 poster)

**Authors:** Ernesto Priego

## Abstract
<p>“Online Attention to Digital Humanities Publications” is the final title of the poster I created and worked on with Leo Havemann (Birkbeck College, University of London) and Javiera Atenas (University College London). This poster was presented in the Digital Humanities 2014 conference, Lausanne, Switzerland, July the 10th 2014, 2:00pm – 3:30pm.</p>

